{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0215","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:0000010a:text","row":29914,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"水曜日。","en":"Wednesday.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800732","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00001","en":"Wednesday.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:0000012a:text","row":29915,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"ニュートンも失笑、惰性の法則に従って学校に行く。","en":"Under a law of inertia that would have made even Newton snicker, I went to school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800733","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00002","en":"Even Newton would end up laughing at how I am going to school in obedience to the Law of Inertia.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:00000172:text","row":29916,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"坂を歩く。","en":"I walked up the hill.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800734","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00003","en":"I walk the hills.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:00000194:text","row":29917,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"いつもながら勾配がきつい。","en":"As always, the grade was punishing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800735","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00004","en":"The inclines are severe, as always.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:000001c6:text","row":29918,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"歩みは遅くなる。","en":"My pace slowed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800736","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00005","en":"Pace grows slower.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:000001ee:text","row":29919,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ようやっと平らな場所に出る。","en":"At last I reached level ground.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800737","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00006","en":"At last I come out into a flat place.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:00000440:text","row":29920,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800738","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00007","en":"Taichi: \"...!\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:00000462:text","row":29921,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"予感に焙(あぶ)られて、意識が加熱した。","en":"A premonition scorched me, and my awareness flared hot.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800739","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00008","en":"Broiled by a premonition, awareness heats up.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:000004a0:text","row":29922,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"理性よりはやく体は動く。","en":"My body moved faster than reason.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800740","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00009","en":"The body moves faster than rationality.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:000004d0:text","row":29923,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"振り返った！","en":"I spun around!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800741","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00010","en":"I turned around!","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:000004fc:text","row":29924,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………いないか」","en":"“…………No one there.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800742","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00011","en":"Taichi: \"......not there?\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0215:00000528:text","row":29925,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"人の気配を感じたのに。","en":"Even though I’d sensed someone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800743","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0036b:00012","en":"But I felt the presence of a person.","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
